<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠν-άγχη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων, ἄγχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dog-quinsy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				604a5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				23.2
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑάγχη</span>: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sore throat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prog.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i> (all pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνάγχη</span> is a constant
			v.l., but <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνάγχη</span> as
				<i>an inflammation of the larynx</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνάγχη</span>
			<i>of the interior muscles of the throat</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρασυνάγχη</span>
			<i>of the exterior muscles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.248
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17(2).706
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>dog's collar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.34
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>, 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνακτάν</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>pillory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
